# Line ending policy.
#
# Store text files with LF in the repository and check them out with the
# line endings native to whichever machine you are on. Without this, a
# OneDrive sync round trip can flip every file to Windows CRLF and make
# git report the whole repo as modified when nothing has actually changed.
* text=auto

# Files that must never be treated as text. Line ending conversion would
# corrupt them. The .skill file is a zip archive, so it belongs here too.
*.skill binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.webp  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
